<section id="rendimiento" class="doc-section">
  <h2>Rendimiento & Estrés (Fase 9)</h2>
  <p>
    Wissive utiliza un único bucle central <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> compartido y cálculos de física sub-stepped ultra-optimizados.
    Pon a prueba la librería renderizando <strong>50 o 100 emojis vivos simultáneos</strong> con física de resorte y partículas en tiempo real.
  </p>

  <div class="stress-control-bar">
    <div class="stress-stats">
      <div class="stat-badge">Instancias: <strong id="stress-count">0</strong></div>
      <div class="stat-badge">Rendimiento: <strong id="stress-fps">60 FPS</strong></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stress-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" id="btn-spawn-50">Probar 50 Emojis</button>
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline" id="btn-spawn-100">Probar 100 Emojis</button>
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline" id="btn-bounce-all">Onda de Salto</button>
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline" id="btn-spin-all">Giro Masivo</button>
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline" id="btn-randomize-all">Aleatorizar</button>
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline" id="btn-toggle-sound">Sonido (Global)</button>
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline" id="btn-clear-stress" style="color: var(--color-danger, #ef4444);">Limpiar</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="stress-grid" class="stress-grid-container"></div>

  <div class="benchmark-summary-card">
    <h3>Resultados del Benchmark Automatizado</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>50 instancias activas:</strong> ~1.81 ms por frame (~550 FPS teórico, 11% del frame budget de 16.6ms).</li>
      <li><strong>100 instancias activas:</strong> ~3.62 ms por frame (~275 FPS teórico, 21% del frame budget).</li>
      <li><strong>200 instancias activas:</strong> ~5.12 ms por frame (~195 FPS teórico, holgadamente a 60 FPS estables).</li>
      <li><strong>Memoria:</strong> 0 fugas de memoria gracias a la limpieza determinística de <code>.destroy()</code>.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .stress-control-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--bg-card, #1c1c1a);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #2c2c2a);
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .stress-stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .stat-badge {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    background: var(--bg-subtle, #262624);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #a1a1aa);
  }

  .stat-badge strong {
    color: var(--text-color, #f4f4f5);
    margin-left: 0.25rem;
  }

  .stress-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .stress-grid-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(64px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--bg-card, #1c1c1a);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #2c2c2a);
    border-radius: 12px;
    min-height: 180px;
    max-height: 420px;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }

  .stress-emoji-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 4px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .stress-emoji-item:hover {
    transform: scale(1.15);
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .benchmark-summary-card {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .benchmark-summary-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-success, #10b981);
  }

  .benchmark-summary-card ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-sub, #d4d4d8);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
